\textbf{Summary:} ``The paper proposes Neural PDE, a continuous spatiotemporal modeling framework that extends Neural ODEs to capture both spatial and temporal dynamics\ldots'' &
\textbf{Summary:} ``This paper proposes Neural PDE, a framework for continuously modeling spatiotemporal dynamical systems that addresses key limitations of Neural ODEs\ldots'' &
\textbf{Summary:} \colorbox{green!15}{``This paper proposes Neural PDE, a method for reconstructing full spatiotemporal dynamics from sparse observations\ldots''} \\[3pt]
\textbf{Weakness:} ``Clarity of Research Objective: The paper needs to clarify its main focus. It is currently unclear whether the goal is to extend Neural ODEs to spatiotemporal settings\ldots'' &
\textbf{Weakness:} ``The comparison against relevant neural operator baselines (FNO, LNO) is needed to contextualize performance gains\ldots'' &
